0..77 Comment "// What a motive refuses when its body writes a type with no `return`. A type"
78..155 Comment "// is a value, and a body is a computation. So a type family\'s application in"
156..229 Comment "// the body refuses by its sort, as a type atom does. The refusal advises"
230..242 Comment "// `return`."
